{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Citlali": 53,
    "Leyla": 1,
    "Ororon": 57,
    "Paimon": 41,
    "Player": 26
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4017101",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401710101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401710101": {
            "id": "401710101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Once {NICKNAME} shows up, everything will get better...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710102"
            ]
          },
          "401710102": {
            "id": "401710102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! Ororon, over here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710103"
            ]
          },
          "401710103": {
            "id": "401710103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Oh, hey there, {NICKNAME} and Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710104"
            ]
          },
          "401710104": {
            "id": "401710104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, you were looking for us? We came as soon as we heard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710105"
            ]
          },
          "401710105": {
            "id": "401710105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "You did? That makes me feel... warm and fuzzy. Is this what happiness feels like?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710106"
            ]
          },
          "401710106": {
            "id": "401710106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...The heck? Where is this coming from...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710107"
            ]
          },
          "401710107": {
            "id": "401710107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "You are truly the best friends I could ask for. If my vegetables met you, I'm sure they'd grow all the more lush for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710108"
            ]
          },
          "401710108": {
            "id": "401710108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... what makes you say that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710109"
            ]
          },
          "401710109": {
            "id": "401710109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Well, it's a compliment. I heard that complimenting people makes them happy. Did it work? Are you happy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710110"
            ]
          },
          "401710110": {
            "id": "401710110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Very much so, but what about you? You don't look too happy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710111"
            ]
          },
          "401710111": {
            "id": "401710111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "It's that obvious, huh? Well, you're right. I feel like an aphid who can't find a flower. Granny is standing in my way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710113"
            ]
          },
          "401710113": {
            "id": "401710113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You mean, Citlali?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710114"
            ]
          },
          "401710114": {
            "id": "401710114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Yes. Granny's a genius, as you know. Geniuses often stand in the way of others, leading them to despair.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710115"
            ]
          },
          "401710115": {
            "id": "401710115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "And on top of that, I'm her grandson. Which means I get a double dose of despair.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710116"
            ]
          },
          "401710116": {
            "id": "401710116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "If that sounds serious... it's because it is. So please, help me deal with her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710117"
            ]
          },
          "401710117": {
            "id": "401710117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What happened, exactly? You make it sound so dramatic...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710118"
            ]
          },
          "401710118": {
            "id": "401710118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I had to get you involved. Most people can't deal with Granny, and...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710120",
              "401710122"
            ]
          },
          "401710120": {
            "id": "401710120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Exactly! You were the first person I thought of, {M#Gramps}{F#other Granny}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710123"
            ]
          },
          "401710123": {
            "id": "401710123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#{M#\"Gramps\"}{F#\"Granny\"} is what I called you when we first met, and I know I got told off for it... but please let me off for calling you that one more time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710124"
            ]
          },
          "401710124": {
            "id": "401710124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "It feels like there's something unique about you. Even Granny Citlali treats you like you're someone special. And everything that's happened since we met suggests it's true.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710125"
            ]
          },
          "401710125": {
            "id": "401710125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "If I had a woven scroll that listed the forty people who can deal with Granny Citlali, your name would be at the top of that list.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710126"
            ]
          },
          "401710126": {
            "id": "401710126",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, so who are these other thirty-nine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710127"
            ]
          },
          "401710127": {
            "id": "401710127",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#They're also {NICKNAME}. A whole thirty-nine {NICKNAME} after the first one."
          },
          "401710122": {
            "id": "401710122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Of course you can! You were the first person I thought of, {M#Gramps}{F#other Granny}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4017102",
      "subQuestName": "Head to where Ororon is",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4017103",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the location pointed out by Ororon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401710201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401710201": {
            "id": "401710201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "...Huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710202"
            ]
          },
          "401710202": {
            "id": "401710202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710203"
            ]
          },
          "401710203": {
            "id": "401710203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "It's Granny... She's gone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710204"
            ]
          },
          "401710204": {
            "id": "401710204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "She was standing there at the cave entrance to stop me from going in. Standing right in my way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710205"
            ]
          },
          "401710205": {
            "id": "401710205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, you meant literally standing in your way... This whole time, Paimon thought you were being metaphorical.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710206"
            ]
          },
          "401710206": {
            "id": "401710206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Granny says it's tacky when light novels use contrived metaphors. I don't wanna be tacky.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710207"
            ]
          },
          "401710207": {
            "id": "401710207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, but aren't you comparing yourself to a light novel? Isn't that kinda contrived...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710208"
            ]
          },
          "401710208": {
            "id": "401710208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "What? Oh... darn it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710209"
            ]
          },
          "401710209": {
            "id": "401710209",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Anyway, looks like your path ahead has been cleared.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710210"
            ]
          },
          "401710210": {
            "id": "401710210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, Citlali probably figured there was no point standing in your way anymore. Ororon, whatever it is you so desperately need to do, you're now free to do it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710211"
            ]
          },
          "401710211": {
            "id": "401710211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I don't think it'll be that simple... Granny wouldn't release me from her grasp so easily.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710212"
            ]
          },
          "401710212": {
            "id": "401710212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "She might have laid a trap for me. Or maybe when I get inside, I'll get caught by one of her surveillance spells...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710213"
            ]
          },
          "401710213": {
            "id": "401710213",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But why would she want to stop you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710214"
            ]
          },
          "401710214": {
            "id": "401710214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, let alone lay a trap for you! Unless... You haven't been up to no good again, have you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710215"
            ]
          },
          "401710215": {
            "id": "401710215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I just want to rescue someone... and Granny won't let me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710216"
            ]
          },
          "401710216": {
            "id": "401710216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Rescue someone!? Oh no, what happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710217"
            ]
          },
          "401710217": {
            "id": "401710217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Could I ask you to go inside and take a look at him? I think he should be safe for now, but he'll be at greater and greater risk as time goes by.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710218"
            ]
          },
          "401710218": {
            "id": "401710218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But then... What are you going to do?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710219"
            ]
          },
          "401710219": {
            "id": "401710219",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I'll have to wait outside, or I might fall into one of Granny's traps.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710220"
            ]
          },
          "401710220": {
            "id": "401710220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...You mean, you want us to fall into her traps instead?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710221"
            ]
          },
          "401710221": {
            "id": "401710221",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#No, you'll be fine. Granny's traps will recognize it's {NICKNAME}, so they'll leave you alone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710222"
            ]
          },
          "401710222": {
            "id": "401710222",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Really? That's a thing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710223"
            ]
          },
          "401710223": {
            "id": "401710223",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Sure it is — I mean, I've told my aphids all about your heroic deeds, so I assume Granny's told her traps, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710224"
            ]
          },
          "401710224": {
            "id": "401710224",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You... You can't just assume that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710225"
            ]
          },
          "401710225": {
            "id": "401710225",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Either way... I'm counting on you, {M#Gramps}{F#Granny}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710226"
            ]
          },
          "401710226": {
            "id": "401710226",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Well, {NICKNAME}, sounds like someone's life is at stake so we should probably head in and check things out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4017107",
      "subQuestName": "Enter the cave to check on the situation",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401710701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401710701": {
            "id": "401710701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh! The woven scroll is ready! This looks like a person... Who is it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710702"
            ]
          },
          "401710702": {
            "id": "401710702",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710703"
            ]
          },
          "401710703": {
            "id": "401710703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710704"
            ]
          },
          "401710704": {
            "id": "401710704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "It's Sanhaj Kompore...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710705"
            ]
          },
          "401710705": {
            "id": "401710705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? You mean, THAT Sanhaj? Ororon's ancient name hero guy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710706"
            ]
          },
          "401710706": {
            "id": "401710706",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "That's right. He was not only one of the six heroes, but also a legendary Border Master of our tribe. Five hundred years on, and the remains of his spirit is still so strong...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710707"
            ]
          },
          "401710707": {
            "id": "401710707",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "\"Border Master\" is a honorable title, by the way. It's only given to powerful figures, like Granny Citlali.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710708"
            ]
          },
          "401710708": {
            "id": "401710708",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "No, not like me. The most powerful Border Masters can expand the borders of the Night Kingdom, and temporarily manifest part of it in the real world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710709"
            ]
          },
          "401710709": {
            "id": "401710709",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I'm no amateur with border spells, but Sanhaj is in a league of his own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710710"
            ]
          },
          "401710710": {
            "id": "401710710",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "They say his border mastery was what turned the tide in the Battle of the Mare Jivari five hundred years ago. Legend has it that Sanhaj summoned a miniature Night Kingdom and exploded it to defeat the encroaching dark calamity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710711"
            ]
          },
          "401710711": {
            "id": "401710711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! He must have been really strong!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710712"
            ]
          },
          "401710712": {
            "id": "401710712",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Of course, it came at a great price. As far as I understand, both Sanhaj and Tenoch, the leader of the tribal coalition forces, gave their lives to activate this spell.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710713"
            ]
          },
          "401710713": {
            "id": "401710713",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I don't know what Leyla was thinking... Even I'd think twice before seeking out Sanhaj Kompore during clairvoyance, so what sort of spirit-duffer in their right mind would... Hmph, I guess folly is the greater part of bravery.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710714"
            ]
          },
          "401710714": {
            "id": "401710714",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I'm starting to feel like something else is at play here. I think I'll pay a visit to his house and see if I can find any clues.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710715"
            ]
          },
          "401710715": {
            "id": "401710715",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What about the other approach? Shall we keep that up while you're gone?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710716"
            ]
          },
          "401710716": {
            "id": "401710716",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Yep, you can keep gathering the roaming spirits, that won't be affected. Hopefully you do find Leyla that way, because it'll save us an awful lot of trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710717"
            ]
          },
          "401710717": {
            "id": "401710717",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "But before that, it looks like we now have another problem on our hands. Connecting with the spirit of Sanhaj Kompore has caused quite a stir... I think we may have just spooked all the monsters in the area.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710718"
            ]
          },
          "401710718": {
            "id": "401710718",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, if you've got some time, could you go and get them to pipe down a bit? We don't want them to start attacking innocent bystanders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710719"
            ]
          },
          "401710719": {
            "id": "401710719",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "It's fine, I can handle that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710720"
            ]
          },
          "401710720": {
            "id": "401710720",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "#Oh no — you're staying right here, mister! {NICKNAME} has enough to do already without coming to your rescue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710721"
            ]
          },
          "401710721": {
            "id": "401710721",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Alright then... Sorry, {NICKNAME}. Over to you, I guess.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710722"
            ]
          },
          "401710722": {
            "id": "401710722",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No problem, it'll be a piece of cake.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710723"
            ]
          },
          "401710723": {
            "id": "401710723",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, don't sweat it. The most important thing right now is getting Leyla's spirit back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710724"
            ]
          },
          "401710724": {
            "id": "401710724",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Alright, I'm heading out. See you guys later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4017104",
      "subQuestName": "Enter the cave to check on the situation",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401710401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401710401": {
            "id": "401710401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew, we made it in without a hitch! Maybe Citlali's traps can recognize us after all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710402"
            ]
          },
          "401710402": {
            "id": "401710402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, look! There's someone there!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710403"
            ]
          },
          "401710403": {
            "id": "401710403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hi! Are you okay? Can you hear us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710404"
            ]
          },
          "401710404": {
            "id": "401710404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He's not responding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710405"
            ]
          },
          "401710405": {
            "id": "401710405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is he asleep? Or sick? ...Do you think this is the guy Ororon was talking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710406"
            ]
          },
          "401710406": {
            "id": "401710406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Also, what the heck's been going on here? Lots of strange and mysterious stuff around...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710407"
            ]
          },
          "401710407": {
            "id": "401710407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Looks like some kind of ritual.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710408"
            ]
          },
          "401710408": {
            "id": "401710408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, could be... Let's get Ororon in here. He'll know what this is all about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710409"
            ]
          },
          "401710409": {
            "id": "401710409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Sorry, Granny.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710410"
            ]
          },
          "401710410": {
            "id": "401710410",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "All grown up now, are we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710411"
            ]
          },
          "401710411": {
            "id": "401710411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "...I'm truly sorry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710412"
            ]
          },
          "401710412": {
            "id": "401710412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Now that you're one of the six heroes, you think you can do as you please, do you? Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710413"
            ]
          },
          "401710413": {
            "id": "401710413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Well? Explain yourself, you dummy! How exactly were you thinking of helping that spirit-duffer?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710414"
            ]
          },
          "401710414": {
            "id": "401710414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ororon! And, uhh... hey, Citlali.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710415"
            ]
          },
          "401710415": {
            "id": "401710415",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Huh? HUH??? When did you guys...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710416"
            ]
          },
          "401710416": {
            "id": "401710416",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "#(Drat, I wasn't expecting them. And now {NICKNAME} probably caught me yelling at Ororon... Aah, this is not a good look for me!)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710417"
            ]
          },
          "401710417": {
            "id": "401710417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Haha... Hello there, you two. We were just, um... Ororon and I, we were, uh... play acting...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710418"
            ]
          },
          "401710418": {
            "id": "401710418",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "You know, acting out some scenes from a light novel, quoting the lines... I didn't actually mean what I was saying. Right, Ororon?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710419"
            ]
          },
          "401710419": {
            "id": "401710419",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Huh? Uh... Yes, that's right.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710420"
            ]
          },
          "401710420": {
            "id": "401710420",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#I owe you an apology too, {NICKNAME}. I asked you for help, but I forgot to watch my back, and Granny caught me... And now we're play-acting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710425",
              "401710424"
            ]
          },
          "401710425": {
            "id": "401710425",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, what are you two up to, exactly? Did something happen to this poor guy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710426"
            ]
          },
          "401710426": {
            "id": "401710426",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Yeah — Leyla's his name. He got into some trouble during a clairvoyance session.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710427"
            ]
          },
          "401710427": {
            "id": "401710427",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Clairvoyance?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710428"
            ]
          },
          "401710428": {
            "id": "401710428",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "It's a kind of spell that lets your spirit leave your body, so you can access secret knowledge. You know what a medium is, right? You've probably come across them in novels. Anyway, it's similar to that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710429"
            ]
          },
          "401710429": {
            "id": "401710429",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Leyla's problem is, his spirit has gotten lost and can't find its way back to his body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710430"
            ]
          },
          "401710430": {
            "id": "401710430",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, in other words, his body's here, but his soul's gone!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710431"
            ]
          },
          "401710431": {
            "id": "401710431",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Well, technically the soul and the spirit aren't quite the same thing... but yes, in a nutshell, that's basically it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710432"
            ]
          },
          "401710432": {
            "id": "401710432",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I just wanted to help bring Leyla's spirit back...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710433"
            ]
          },
          "401710433": {
            "id": "401710433",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hmph, and I wouldn't have stopped him if it was anyone else. But the issue is, Mr. Leyla here is what we call a \"spirit-duffer.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710434"
            ]
          },
          "401710434": {
            "id": "401710434",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's a spirit-duffer?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710435"
            ]
          },
          "401710435": {
            "id": "401710435",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Someone with no spiritual sensitivity whatsoever. Spirit-duffers can't sense or control spirits, much less use spells on them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710436"
            ]
          },
          "401710436": {
            "id": "401710436",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Now, there are certain methods that can force even spirit-duffers into a clairvoyant state, but... well, I mean, look what happened to Mr. Leyla.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710437"
            ]
          },
          "401710437": {
            "id": "401710437",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "The spells of the Masters of the Night-Wind are all based on dealing with spirits, and so are all our problem-solving methods. So for spirit-duffers, even our healing methods don't work on them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710438"
            ]
          },
          "401710438": {
            "id": "401710438",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "So if they get into trouble trying to use a spell, there's basically nothing we can do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710439"
            ]
          },
          "401710439": {
            "id": "401710439",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Yes, there is. As long as the soul is involved, I should be able to help...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710440"
            ]
          },
          "401710440": {
            "id": "401710440",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "You hear that? No prizes for guessing what Ororon's bright idea was.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710441"
            ]
          },
          "401710441": {
            "id": "401710441",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh! Because of your special constitution, right? But isn't that kinda risky for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710442"
            ]
          },
          "401710442": {
            "id": "401710442",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I'll be fine — Granny's just worrying too much. I'm feeling fine now, so I should be able to do it safely. Besides, it's probably our only hope of bringing Leyla back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710443"
            ]
          },
          "401710443": {
            "id": "401710443",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Don't kid yourself. What happens if it's not as safe as you're hoping, hmm? We both know you'll risk it all to try and rescue him anyway. Honestly, you're such an idiot sometimes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401710444"
            ]
          },
          "401710444": {
            "id": "401710444",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um... This is a tricky one. It's true that Ororon can be self-sacrificing to a fault, but it's also true that Citlali tends to worry too much..."
          },
          "401710424": {
            "id": "401710424",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Come on. Now's not the time for games."
          }
        }
      }
    },
